claim.claim-text:
a core shaft (22);
a coil (24) wound around on an outer periphery of a region of a front end side of the core shaft (22);
a tip (26) joined to a front end of the core shaft (22) and a front end of the coil (24);
a coil-core shaft joining region (25) joining a rear end of the coil (24) with the core shaft (22);
a first insulating resin tube (31) disposed on an outer periphery of the coil (24); and
a third insulating resin tube (33 -Fig. 3; 35, 36, 37 -Fig. 4);
characterized in that
the first insulating resin tube (31) extends from the tip (26) to a portion located rearwardly and away from the rear end of the coil (24); and
the third insulating resin tube (33 -Fig. 3; 35, 36, 37 -Fig. 4) is disposed on at least a portion of a region of an inner periphery of the first insulating resin tube (31), the region being located rearwardly relative to a position facing the rear end of the coil (24), the third insulating resin tube (33 -Fig. 3; 35, 36, 37 -Fig. 4) being harder than the first insulating resin tube (31).
